        After 15+ years in the engine rooms of Fortune 500s, federal
        contractors, and high-growth SaaS — across roles spanning sysadmin,
        database, DevOps, cloud architecture, and QA — one pattern kept
        repeating.
      </p>
      <p>
        Small businesses needed enterprise-grade IT but couldn’t afford the
        enterprise headcount. The right move was almost never a $200K
        full-time CTO hire — it was a partner who’d already done the work at
        scale and could deliver that depth without the overhead.
      </p>
      <p>
        Preston East exists for that exact gap. Founded by
        <span class="text-fg font-medium">Flo Ogunleye</span>, the practice
        brings the cloud, security, development, and strategy depth small
        businesses need — without forcing them to build a full IT department
        to get it.
      </p>
